# Caddy TLS reverse proxy — memory gatekeeper

Place on the team VM in front of `agentctl memory serve` (bind `127.0.0.1:8741` only).

```caddyfile
memory.example.com {
  encode gzip
  reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8741
  header {
    Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains"
    -Server
  }
}
```

Clients:

```bash
export AGENTCTL_GATEWAY_URL=https://memory.example.com
export AGENTCTL_USER_ID=you@company.com
export AGENTCTL_GROUPS=your-team
```

Do not expose SQLite or SSH memory shells to the public internet; only this HTTP surface.
